WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.002
Eddy was scared.

2
00:00:13.003 --> 00:00:17.250
The bridge was too high!

3
00:00:17.251 --> 00:00:21.212
"Go ahead, Eddy!" said Ms. Fender.

4
00:00:21.213 --> 00:00:24.550
"Drive across the bridge."

5
00:00:24.551 --> 00:00:27.704
Eddy backed up a little.

6
00:00:27.705 --> 00:00:32.357
"Go, Eddy!" Poppy cheered.

7
00:00:32.358 --> 00:00:36.994
"You can do it!"

8
00:00:36.995 --> 00:00:40.804
"Eddy is brave!" said Dipper.

9
00:00:40.805 --> 00:00:46.903
"He's braver than we are!" said Jeb.

10
00:00:46.904 --> 00:00:53.592
Zippy laughed.

11
00:00:53.593 --> 00:00:56.421
"Eddy is not brave.

12
00:00:56.422 --> 00:00:58.715
He's scared!"

13
00:00:58.716 --> 00:01:02.683
Eddy felt hot all over.

14
00:01:02.684 --> 00:01:07.819
"I'm not scared!" he yelled.

15
00:01:07.820 --> 00:01:11.192
"Oh yeah?" said Zippy.

16
00:01:11.193 --> 00:01:14.294
"Then cross the bridge."

17
00:01:14.295 --> 00:01:17.217
"Fine," said Eddy.

18
00:01:17.218 --> 00:01:21.019
"I will!"

19
00:01:21.020 --> 00:01:30.315
Eddy took a deep breath.

20
00:01:30.316 --> 00:01:34.765
He rolled onto the bridge.

21
00:01:34.766 --> 00:01:41.126
Eddy drove very slowly.

22
00:01:41.127 --> 00:01:44.759
"I can be brave," he thought.

23
00:01:44.760 --> 00:01:50.369
"I just won't look down."

